  "description": "Sa Hara has been going through a bit of a dry spell…a 29-year one, to be exactly. All she wants is to be able to enjoy her raunchy rendezvous, but no man seems to be able to find a way to satisfy her. In the throes of desperation, she makes a wish upon a fountain that is rumored to grant one’s wish - with a price. That very same night, an unexpected visitor comes to give her a truly magical experience!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 4 side stories.*",
